Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:08.26,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,250,750,4000,4500)\pos(653.755,440.122)}Episode 77 \N\N\N\N\NAutumn Wind Over Wuzhang Plain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:34.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321,450)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:50.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(362.8,422.4)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:56.77,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I pray to the Seven Stars of the Northern Dipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:01.33,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}If the master lamp remains lit for seven days,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:05.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}my life may last another twelve years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:12.77,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}If the lamp goes out, then I am to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:18.69,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Keep all other people outside my tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:26.93,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}A few page-boys is enough to bring me the necessary tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:47.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I was born into a world of chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:52.04,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}content to pass my time by the woods and river.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:58.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Yet I owe to Emperor Zhaolie the grace of his three visits and his last will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:05.40,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}So I shall work the labor of dogs and horses to conquer the villains of the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:28.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}With the faltering of the host star, my death has been marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:34.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}In humility, I write down this testament to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:45.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}May the Heavens show mercy, hear me from above and preserve the life of its servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:54.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}So I may fulfill my duty to His Majesty\N and aid the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:03:00.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Restore the domain of old,\N and safeguard the reign of Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:10.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Forgive my outrage, for my feelings are sincere. \NMay heaven save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.21,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(925.067,481.867)}Fèi Yī\NStyled: Wénwěi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:22.61,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(966.933,494.933)}Yáng Yí\NStyled: Wēigōng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:44.79,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.6,497.333)}Sīmǎ Yì\NStyled: Zhòngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Any news of the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Six nights I have prayed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}the master lamp is still shining bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}If Heaven shows mercy, I may still live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It is to Chancellor's fortune that Heaven blesses us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One last night remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Secure the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,From all other persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers, recently I have observed the constellations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The host star is abnormal, \Nand the enemy avoids all contact with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou Ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Scout out Wuzhang plains with a detachment of one thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If the enemy does not engage,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:06:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang must be deeply ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and that means we can strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(355.467,484)}Xiàhóu Bà \NStyled: Zhòngquán
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not panic! Death to anyone who abandons his post!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan, how dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:14.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang is not at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.07,0:08:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I was ignorant, please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:25.61,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941.333,463.619)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the enemy are attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi knows I am sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,he has sent someone to probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You may engage them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me to the inner tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the enemy give you pursuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They pursued us for twenty{\i1} li {\i0}from their camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that Zhuge Liang is not ill after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.85,0:10:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe the enemy closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:50.35,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Your Majesty, the campaign for the North has not succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:56.63,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Grave illness has struck me, \Nand my life is at an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:11:02.19,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}It fills me with endless regret,\N that I can no longer serve Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:07.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I only humbly wish that Your Majesty may abstain from idle desires,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:10.13,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and to care for the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:13.73,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}to show filial piety to the late Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:17.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}and extend compassion and benevolence to all under heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:24.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Seek out those recluse scholars that may promote the able and kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:29.71,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}uphold the moral standard by rejecting the wicked and the sinuous...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't strain yourself anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For the fate of our Han dynasty, and of our army ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.09,0:11:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, on the behalf of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My sickness this time is not as it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is nearing its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that I have learned from all these years I shall write down for posterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet look at my hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:35.44,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Striving to the utmost, \Nunto one's dying day."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:44.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296.533,389.6)}Liú Shàn \NStyled: Gōngsì
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,May Your Majesty please send someone to inquire of the Chancellor's last arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can We send?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Li Fu may be entrusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him to the frontlines to ask for Chancellor's well-being, and his future arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}All that I've learned are now written in military books of twenty four volumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}In it are the methods of Eight Imperatives, the Seven Precautions, the Six Terrors and the Five Fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Of all the generals, you are the only one I shall pass them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Be sure to study with devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Ma Dai here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:45.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(327.2,507.733)}Mǎ Dài
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.76,0:16:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor may rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and summon Yang Yi to the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,After my death, Wei Yan is bound to mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time comes, you may open this envelope at the battlefront.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:18:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will come forth to execute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-How is the Chancellor?\N-Please come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, His Majesty has sent Secretary Li Fu to inquire for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.6,464)}Lǐ Fǔ \NStyled: Sūndé
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:19:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is deeply shocked by the tiding of your illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so he sent me to visit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am unfortunate that I have to leave too soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,forsaking the nation's cause, indebted to all under heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.19,0:19:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor's words are too grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}After I die, you shall all serve the Emperor with utmost loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The standards of the state are not to be tampered with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Those whom I assigned must not be dismissed in light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,666)}I passed on the military arts to Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}He will inherit my last will to serve and give all to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,666)}When I die, do not mourn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Should Sima Yi become aware, decamp from the rear first,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,666)}and withdraw one camp at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,666)}Should Sima Yi pursue us,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\}regroup and form up,\N hoist all banners to engage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,666)}When he comes, do as according to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The Chancellor may rest assured, I have prepared everything as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor? Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}His Majesty inquires, who may succeed you after your passing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.77,0:21:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Jiang Wan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}And after Jiang Wan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Fei Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}And after Fei Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the Shu have made no movements at all recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.07,0:22:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.53,0:22:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Father should use this chance to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we maintain our drills, do not attack until otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief-Clerk Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.98,0:23:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the camp...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.15,0:23:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,... See the men...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.94,0:24:01.00,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,"Restore the Central Plains."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.01,0:24:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.69,0:24:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:48.47,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:53.27,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:59.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:03.16,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can no longer conquer \Nthe enemy at the battlefront...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.85,0:25:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens lasting, why so unkind...?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.55,0:26:20.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang, Chancellor of the Han, passed away at Wuzhang Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:24.43,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Dying at the age of fifty-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.64,0:26:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, the enemy has withdrawn from Wuzhang Plains!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.48,0:26:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.09,0:26:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Commander expected, Zhuge Liang is really dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.93,0:26:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu forces are retreating!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I was too cautious and missed this golden opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.21,0:26:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, dispatch all troops to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.94,0:26:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.08,0:27:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.61,0:27:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang still lives?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi, you have fallen for our Chancellor's trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.45,0:27:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.17,0:27:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.60,0:27:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.01,0:28:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, have no fear, the enemy cannot reach us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.56,0:28:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.68,0:28:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my head still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.48,0:28:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.40,0:28:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Have no fear, Commander. The enemy is far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.55,0:28:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang's divine cunning knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell for his ruse once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.32,0:28:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat to the base!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.84,0:28:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat to the base!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.36,0:28:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.68,0:29:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.08,0:29:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nobody at the Shu campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.05,0:29:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They have retreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.88,0:29:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The locals say the Shu army were flying white banners and mourned in the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.32,0:29:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is indeed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Jiang Wei stayed with a thousand troops as rearguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.84,0:29:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Zhuge Liang we saw on the chariot\N was a wooden sculpture.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.54,0:29:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A sculpture?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.44,0:29:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.20,0:29:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A sculpture...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.39,0:29:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang, even in death, you leave such meticulous plans behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.56,0:29:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A genius. An extraordinary genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.60,0:29:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I could foresee you alive, \Nyet not foresee you in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.93,0:30:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.16,0:30:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu forces are far away now. \NShall we extend another pursuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.44,0:30:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.00,0:30:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is dead,\Nwe may now rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.13,0:30:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The main army will return to Chang'an, \Nthe rest of your units will stand guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.20,0:30:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will report to His Majesty in Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.00,0:30:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.16,0:31:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn the gallery roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.80,0:31:05.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.50,0:31:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the gallery roads have been burnt down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.12,0:31:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was General Wei, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.96,0:31:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.36,0:31:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wei ordered the troops to burn the road and bar the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.84,0:32:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The late Chancellor foretold this man would mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.48,0:32:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That day has indeed come.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.14,0:32:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He was assigned as rearguard, but instead cut off our retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.12,0:32:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what is to be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.48,0:32:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know of a nearby detour named Chashan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.28,0:32:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Although steep and dangerous, it bypasses the gallery roads and leads directly to Nanzheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.25,0:32:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan must be trying \Nto reach for the Emperor first,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.13,0:32:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,claiming us as mutineers, so he burned the trail to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We must send a messenger to Chengdu first and report to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, we will follow behind with the Chancellor's hearse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.81,0:32:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We move along the Chashan detour to safeguard Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.48,0:32:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and send a unit to intercept Wei Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.88,0:32:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Order General Wang Ping to advance with three thousand men,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.01,0:32:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,get behind Wei Yan to intercept him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.16,0:32:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.14,0:33:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan, you mutinous fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.26,0:33:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You defy your orders and now burned the gallery road,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.88,0:33:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,dismount and accept your guilt!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.93,0:33:15.69,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(377.333,460.8)}Wáng Píng\NStyled: Zǐjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.56,0:33:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor may be dead, but I am still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.00,0:33:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yang Yi is but a clerk, how could he command our army?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.24,0:33:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He should concern himself with the Chancellor's burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.68,0:33:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I alone can launch the offensive on Sima Yi and succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we forsake the affairs of state for the Chancellor alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.37,0:33:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now as Yang Yi has rejected my advice and made a full retreat,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.14,0:33:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,it is in my right to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.12,0:33:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the Chancellor's last order.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.94,0:33:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Chancellor had taken my advice to advance via Ziwu Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.59,0:33:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chang'an would have fallen long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.48,0:34:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, instead of aiding me to fight against Wei, you help Yang Yi in his mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.04,0:34:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You even dare to insult me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's body has barely gone cold, and yet you already betray him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.40,0:34:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers in arms! You are all men of the Western Riverlands!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.12,0:34:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents, wives, children\Nand friends are all at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.20,0:34:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the Chancellor do you any wrong when he was alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.50,0:34:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not support this mutiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.22,0:34:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers! You must heed the Chancellor's will \Nand return home!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.91,0:34:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be paid your due reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.49,0:34:42.48,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.75,0:34:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.32,0:34:46.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.72,0:34:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.98,0:35:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you help me succeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.16,0:35:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not fail to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have no worries, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.90,0:35:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will succeed as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.32,0:35:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.40,0:35:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we gain a firm foothold in Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.74,0:35:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then gain the will of the Riverlands to accomplish our great cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wisdom and bravery have no equal in the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.76,0:35:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall follow you in your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.34,0:35:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come honor or disgrace, we will never fall apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.02,0:35:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your loyalty is hard to come by!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.48,0:35:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us take Nanzheng first, \Nthen we march to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.56,0:36:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor foresaw your mutiny\Nwhen he was alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.56,0:36:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me to be on the guard. \NToday his words have come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not hard for you to seize\Nmy command and take Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.48,0:36:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you dare to yell "who dares to kill me" three times,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.16,0:36:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,then I acknowledge you as a true hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.72,0:36:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then, shall I yield to you both my command the fortifications of Hangzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your ears, Yang Yi, you cur!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.46,0:36:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When Chancellor was alive, I was at his beck and call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.22,0:36:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that he's dead, who under heaven could rival me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Be it three times or thirty thousand times, I will shout as much as I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.56,0:37:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.92,0:37:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.04,0:37:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.43,0:37:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor left me instructions before he passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.68,0:37:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to behead Wei Yan by surprise\Nas he shouts those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.88,0:37:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,General please rise, your service to the state exemplifies both your loyalty and valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.45,0:37:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us return together back to Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.54,0:37:59.79,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,666)}O dark sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.80,0:38:09.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Why have you given him \Nso soon to autumn wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.57,0:38:17.33,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,666)}O great earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.33,0:38:27.37,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Why have you taken him \Nso soon to your embrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.11,0:38:37.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I'd give my death, \Nfor his life in exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.49,0:38:43.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}to lead again our \Nsoldiers to campaign!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:52.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Gave it all till the end, \Nwho amongst could compare?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.68,0:38:58.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Against his purity \Nwho else could be his peer?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.41,0:39:22.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Dark sky, \N are you without just!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:27.01,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Great earth, \N are you without heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.09,0:39:33.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}All that is left are \Nthe Bāguà Form and the qín.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.24,0:39:47.92,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}To whom else could \Nthe state of Shu rely?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.01,0:39:55.20,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}In agony, do hearts \Nof Shu folk die!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.56,0:40:06.00,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}My family have eight-hundred mulberry trees and fifty qǐng of farmland,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.32,0:40:09.41,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}these are all enough to feed \Nmy family and grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.00,0:40:14.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}During all my time outside, all my needs were taken care of by the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.60,0:40:16.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and thus no need to earn from outside ventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.24,0:40:21.77,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}When I die, let there be no further riches remaining within or outside my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.02,0:40:23.63,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}as not to let down His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.32,0:40:25.63,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,"Tomb of Chancellor of Han, Marquis of Wu District, Zhuge Liang"

